News Anchor : And well, what could be more newsworthy than that, I say?
do OverlayUI.go_to_next_scene()
News Anchor : His new name is [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], named after the technology that keeps his little heart beating.
News Anchor: Although, he doesn't look that little anymore, as you can see.
News Anchor: His creator has told us [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size] can now [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#00cc8b]jump[/color][/wave][/outline_size] and has a fresh new look.
News Anchor: What a world we live in, huh, folks?
News Anchor: Anyways, place your bets now, people. Will our new friend really get to the top? Let's find out!.
